==Battleground==
*5 [[Johnnyleon]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 10~13.33 seconds<sup>300f~400f</sup>.
*2 [[Raynard]]s spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 53.33~56.67 seconds<sup>1,600f~1,700f</sup>.
*15 [[Gabriel]]s spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 20~23.33 seconds<sup>600f~700f</sup>.
*8 [[Zoge]]s spawn after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>, delay 26.67~33.33 seconds<sup>800f~1,000f</sup>.

==Strategy==
[[Sushi Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Roe Cat]] is great in this stage and even able to clear it by itself, but you should also use other units to kill the Johnnyleons fast, namely rushers like [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Awakened Bahamut]], [[Hip Hop Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Can Can Cat]] and [[Idi:N (Special Cat)|Idi:N2]]. Attack and Defense UP [[Cat Combo]]s are also recommended.

It doesn't matter much if your frontline is inside or outside the Raynards' range, as you should be able to win either way by focusing on spamming Roe Cats.

This stage is also able to be [[Cheese]]d. By using Starting Money Up Combos ([[Itchy Riches (Combo)|Itchy Riches]], [[Bento Special (Combo)|Bento Special]] etc), you can immediately spawn [[Curling Cat (Rare Cat)|Green Shell Cat]]. The Johnnyleons and Reynards will not be able to hit the Green Shell. Afterwards, just summon rushers like Can Can Cat, [[Swimmer Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Fishman Cat]] and Awakened Bahamut Cat to clean up the base. It is not recommended to use Awakened Bahamut if he has the [[Explosion]] [[Talents|Talent]] due to the blast pierce knocking the Raynards behind the base.

